      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777394694729,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Create two variables for prt1 and ptr2 -> O(1) space complexity\n2. Set ptr1 to 0 and ptr2 to numbers count - 1\n3. While ptr1 is less than ptr2 -> O(n) time complexity\n    4. Sum numbers[ptr1] + numbers[ptr2]\n    5. If the sum is equal to the target\n        6. Return [ptr1 + 1, ptr2 + 1]\n    7. If sum is less than the target\n        8. Move ptr1 one index to the right\n        9. Go to the line 4\n    10. Else \n        11. Move ptr2 one index to the left\n        12. Go to the line 4\n13. Return an empty array",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Create two variables for prt1 and ptr2 -> O(1) space complexity\n2. Set ptr1 to 0 and ptr2 to numbers count - 1\n3. While ptr1 is less than ptr2 -> O(n) time complexity\n    4. Sum numbers[ptr1] + numbers[ptr2]\n    5. If the sum is equal to the target\n        6. Return [ptr1 + 1, ptr2 + 1]\n    7. If sum is less than the target\n        8. Move ptr1 one index to the right\n        9. Go to the line 4\n    10. Else \n        11. Move ptr2 one index to the left\n        12. Go to the line 4\n13. Return an empty array",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
